&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: left; text-indent: 12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: left"&gt;(2) 無形固定資産&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 48px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 547.99999999999999999999999999px"&gt;
